{
  "id": "dmw7wewmf5dqe",
  "name": "日期范围",
  "tags": [
    "展开",
    "日期"
  ],
  "summary": "按钮显示起止日期，点开展开日历点两次：先定开始、再定结束，区间连续高亮。",
  "usage": "报表时间范围、订单查询、预订日期；需要表达「一段连续时间」而不是两个孤立的日期。",
  "caution": "两个不相关的日期别用区间选择器（用两个独立日期选择器）；范围跨度很大时建议加「近 7 天 / 近 30 天」快捷项。",
  "hint": "点两次选起止日期，区间会高亮",
  "prompt": "【日期范围】目标：按钮上显示「2026-11-05 → 2026-11-12」，点开月历后点两次：第一次定开始、第二次定结束（自动收起）；区间连续高亮，选结束时早于开始的日子不可选。\n\n1) **按钮必须显示完整年份**：格式 `YYYY-MM-DD → YYYY-MM-DD`。只显示 `11-05 → 11-12` 时，跨年的区间（2026-12-28 → 2027-01-05）根本表达不出来。按钮宽度由内容撑开（`white-space:nowrap`），不要固定宽度。\n\n2) **状态用绝对 Date 存，不要存「当月第几天」**：存数字的话切月后同一个数字会变成别的日期。存 `new Date(y, m, d)`，渲染用 `cur >= startDate && cur <= endDate` 比较。\n\n3) 状态机：picking 为 0 时点某天 → 设 start、picking=1、不收起；picking 为 1 时点某天 → 早于 start 忽略，否则设 end、收起。已选完再点 → 重置为新 start。\n\n4) 区间视觉：`start ≤ d ≤ end` 加 `.in-range`（品牌色淡底，grid gap 0 连成一条），两端实心 + 外侧圆角。\n\n5) 禁用：picking=1 时早于 start 的日子 `.dis`。\n\n6) 无障碍：trigger aria-haspopup + aria-expanded；月历 role=\"dialog\"；日期 aria-pressed。\n\n7) 坑：`Date` 比较天然支持跨年；同一天既是 start 又是 end 时给 `.solo`；按钮变长后面板用 `left:50% + 负 margin` 居中，别用 left:0。\n\n8) 配色：区间品牌色淡底，两端实心品牌色。\n\n9) 自动演示：只在 !window.__uiInteractive 时循环（点按钮 → 点 20 号 → 点 28 号 → 收起）。\n\n10) 使用场景：报表/订单的时间范围；两个不相关日期用独立选择器。写进 usage / caution。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;min-height:100vh;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:18px}\n\n.wrap{position:relative}\n\n/* 带上年份后按钮会变长，宽度由内容撑开 */\n.trigger{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:7px 11px;border-radius:9px;\n  border:1px solid var(--ui-border);background:var(--ui-surface);color:var(--ui-text);\n  font:inherit;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;\n  transition:border-color .15s ease,background .15s ease}\n.trigger:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 45%,var(--ui-border))}\n.trigger svg{width:12px;height:12px;flex:0 0 auto}\n.trigger .chev{color:var(--ui-text-dim);transition:transform .2s ease}\n.wrap.open .trigger{border-color:var(--ui-brand);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 7%,var(--ui-surface))}\n.wrap.open .trigger .chev{transform:rotate(180deg)}\n.trigger .arrow{color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-weight:400;margin:0 1px}\n\n.panel{position:absolute;left:50%;top:calc(100% + 8px);width:236px;margin-left:-118px;border-radius:12px;\n  background:var(--ui-surface);border:1px solid var(--ui-border);\n  box-shadow:0 18px 44px color-mix(in srgb,#000 18%,transparent);\n  padding:10px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px;\n  opacity:0;transform:translateY(-4px);pointer-events:none;\n  transition:opacity .16s ease,transform .18s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)}\n.wrap.open .panel{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}\n\n.head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}\n.head b{flex:1;text-align:center;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}\n.head button{width:20px;height:20px;border:0;border-radius:6px;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text-dim);\n  cursor:pointer;font:inherit;font-size:12px;line-height:1;display:grid;place-items:center}\n.head button:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2);color:var(--ui-text)}\n\n.week{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr)}\n.week span{text-align:center;font-size:9px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);padding:2px 0}\n\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:0}\n.day{aspect-ratio:1;border:0;border-radius:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);\n  font:inherit;font-size:10px;cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center;\n  transition:background .12s ease,color .12s ease}\n.day:hover{background:var(--ui-surface-2)}\n.day.blank{pointer-events:none}\n.day.in-range{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-brand) 14%,transparent);color:var(--ui-brand)}\n.day.end{background:var(--ui-brand);color:var(--ui-bg);font-weight:600}\n.day.end.first{border-radius:8px 0 0 8px}\n.day.end.last{border-radius:0 8px 8px 0}\n.day.end.solo{border-radius:8px}\n.day.dis{opacity:.3;pointer-events:none}\n\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  body{padding:10px;align-items:flex-start}\n  .wrap{margin-top:5px}\n  .trigger{font-size:9px;padding:5px 9px;gap:4px}\n  .panel{width:218px;margin-left:-109px;padding:7px;gap:4px}\n  .head b{font-size:10px}\n  .head button{width:17px;height:17px;font-size:11px}\n  .week span{font-size:8px;padding:1px 0}\n  .day{aspect-ratio:auto;height:19px;font-size:9px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .trigger,.panel,.chev,.day{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"wrap\" id=\"wrap\">\n  <button class=\"trigger\" id=\"trigger\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"5\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"/><path d=\"M3.5 9.5h17M8 3v4M16 3v4\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg>\n    <span id=\"label\">2026-11-05 → 2026-11-12</span>\n    <svg class=\"chev\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 4.6 L6 7.4 L9 4.6\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg>\n  </button>\n\n  <div class=\"panel\" id=\"panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-label=\"选择日期范围\">\n    <div class=\"head\">\n      <button id=\"prev\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"上个月\">‹</button>\n      <b id=\"title\">2026 年 11 月</b>\n      <button id=\"next\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"下个月\">›</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"week\"><span>日</span><span>一</span><span>二</span><span>三</span><span>四</span><span>五</span><span>六</span></div>\n    <div class=\"grid\" id=\"grid\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var wrap = document.getElementById('wrap'),\n      trigger = document.getElementById('trigger'),\n      panel = document.getElementById('panel'),\n      grid = document.getElementById('grid'),\n      title = document.getElementById('title'),\n      label = document.getElementById('label'),\n      prev = document.getElementById('prev'),\n      next = document.getElementById('next');\n\n  var year = 2026, month = 10;\n  var startDate = null, endDate = null;\n  var picking = false;\n  var open = false;\n  var timer = null, cursor = null;\n\n  function pad(n){ return n < 10 ? '0' + n : '' + n; }\n\n  /* 完整日期：跨年时也能准确表示 */\n  function fmt(dt){ return dt.getFullYear() + '-' + pad(dt.getMonth() + 1) + '-' + pad(dt.getDate()); }\n\n  function sameDay(a, b){\n    return a && b && a.getFullYear() === b.getFullYear() && a.getMonth() === b.getMonth() && a.getDate() === b.getDate();\n  }\n\n  function triggerText(){\n    if(!startDate) return '选开始日期';\n    if(picking) return fmt(startDate) + ' <i class=\"arrow\">→</i> 选结束';\n    return fmt(startDate) + ' <i class=\"arrow\">→</i> ' + fmt(endDate);\n  }\n\n  function render(){\n    title.textContent = year + ' 年 ' + (month + 1) + ' 月';\n    label.innerHTML = triggerText();\n    grid.innerHTML = '';\n\n    var firstDay = new Date(year, month, 1).getDay();\n    var days = new Date(year, month + 1, 0).getDate();\n\n    for(var i = 0; i < firstDay; i++){\n      var b = document.createElement('span');\n      b.className = 'day blank';\n      grid.appendChild(b);\n    }\n    for(var d = 1; d <= days; d++){\n      var btn = document.createElement('button');\n      btn.type = 'button';\n      btn.className = 'day';\n      btn.textContent = String(d);\n      btn.setAttribute('data-d', d);\n\n      var cur = new Date(year, month, d);\n      var isStart = sameDay(cur, startDate);\n      var isEnd = sameDay(cur, endDate);\n\n      if(startDate && endDate && cur >= startDate && cur <= endDate) btn.classList.add('in-range');\n      if(isStart || isEnd){\n        btn.classList.add('end');\n        if(isStart && isEnd) btn.classList.add('solo');\n        else btn.classList.add(isStart ? 'first' : 'last');\n      }\n      if(picking && startDate && cur < startDate) btn.classList.add('dis');\n\n      btn.addEventListener('click', onPick);\n      grid.appendChild(btn);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function onPick(){\n    var d = Number(this.getAttribute('data-d'));\n    var cur = new Date(year, month, d);\n\n    if(!picking){\n      startDate = cur; endDate = null; picking = true; render();\n      return;\n    }\n    if(startDate && cur < startDate) return;\n    endDate = cur; picking = false;\n    render();\n    setOpen(false);\n  }\n\n  function setOpen(on){\n    open = on;\n    wrap.classList.toggle('open', on);\n    trigger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', on ? 'true' : 'false');\n  }\n\n  trigger.addEventListener('click', function(){ setOpen(!open); });\n  panel.addEventListener('click', function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); });\n\n  prev.addEventListener('click', function(){ month--; if(month < 0){ month = 11; year--; } render(); });\n  next.addEventListener('click', function(){ month++; if(month > 11){ month = 0; year++; } render(); });\n\n  document.addEventListener('keydown', function(e){ if(e.key === 'Escape') setOpen(false); });\n\n  function ensureCursor(){\n    if(cursor) return cursor;\n    if(!window.__uiInteractive && typeof window.__uiDemoCursor === 'function'){\n      cursor = window.__uiDemoCursor();\n    }\n    return cursor;\n  }\n\n  function tap(c, el, cb){\n    c.moveTo(el);\n    setTimeout(function(){\n      c.press();\n      setTimeout(function(){ c.release(); cb(); }, 170);\n    }, 420);\n  }\n\n  function demo(){\n    setOpen(false);\n    startDate = null; endDate = null; picking = false;\n    year = 2026; month = 10;\n    render();\n\n    var c = ensureCursor();\n    if(!c || !c.el) return;\n\n    c.el.classList.add('show');\n\n    tap(c, trigger, function(){\n      setOpen(true);\n      setTimeout(function(){\n        var d20 = grid.querySelector('[data-d=\"20\"]');\n        tap(c, d20, function(){\n          d20.click();\n          setTimeout(function(){\n            var d28 = grid.querySelector('[data-d=\"28\"]');\n            tap(c, d28, function(){\n              d28.click();\n              if(c.hide) c.hide();\n            });\n          }, 700);\n        });\n      }, 600);\n    });\n  }\n\n  function startDemo(){\n    stop();\n    setTimeout(function(){ demo(); timer = setInterval(demo, 4800); }, 400);\n  }\n  function stop(){ if(timer){ clearInterval(timer); timer = null; } }\n\n  render();\n  if(!window.__uiInteractive) startDemo();\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
